      ],
      "article_quote": "负责评价的调用先写一组带权重的子任务评分条件，叫 rubric，再在任务结束后按条件评分。"
    },
    {
      "term": "E / D / RT",
      "kind": "operation",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
        {
          "source_id": "paper",
          "locator": "§3.2–3.6 Table6"
        }
      ],
      "article_quote": "论文把三阶段分别记为 E（执行）、D（委派）、RT（rubric 生成训练）。它们轮流更新同一组参数"
    },
    {
      "term": "LOO",
      "kind": "operation",
      "source_ids": [
        "paper"
      ],
      "source_locators": [
